  <h2>Our Mission</h2>
  <p>
    Salary After Tax Canada provides free, accurate salary calculators for Canadian workers. Our goal is to make tax
    transparency accessible to everyone, whether you're negotiating a new salary, planning your budget, or simply
    curious about where your money goes.
  </p>
  <p>
    We believe every Canadian should be able to understand their paycheque without needing an accounting degree.
    Our calculators break down every deduction (federal tax, provincial tax, CPP/QPP, EI, QPIP) into clear,
    understandable numbers.
  </p>

