  <h2>Data Accuracy</h2>
  <p>
    All tax calculations are based on official data from:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada Revenue Agency (CRA)</a>: Federal tax brackets, CPP rates, EI rates</li>
    <li><a href="https://www.revenuquebec.ca/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Revenu Qu&eacute;bec</a>: QPP and QPIP rates</li>
    <li>Provincial finance ministries: Provincial tax brackets and credits</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Calculations are updated each January when new rates are published. While we strive for accuracy, this tool
    provides estimates and should not replace professional tax advice.
  </p>

